### What were the start and end dates of the military government that began in July 1975 under General Murtala Mohammed and continued under General Olusegun Obasanjo until the Second Republic was established in 1979?
Answer: The military government that began under General Murtala Mohammed on 19 July 1975 and continued under General Olusegun Obasanjo ended with the inauguration of the Second Republic on 1 October 1979.

